    "T2": "G-PLAIN"
   },
   "plant": {
    "kind": "negation",
    "old": "Now, in this age, which is the cream of eras epochs and the quintessence of centuries, because the temperament of the grandees has grown refined and eminent leaders endowed with exalted intellect and lofty judgment have emerged, they have directed pure reflection and decisive thought toward the universal affairs of this life and the afterlife.",
    "new": "Now, in this age, which is not the cream of eras epochs and the quintessence of centuries, because the temperament of the grandees has grown refined and eminent leaders endowed with exalted intellect and lofty judgment have emerged, they have directed pure reflection and decisive thought toward the universal affairs of this life and the afterlife.",
    "how": "\\bis\\b → is not"
   }
  },
