    "T2": "G-PLAIN"
   },
   "plant": {
    "kind": "number",
    "old": "However, where it is lost through neglect or ignorance, the same author shows a distinction: \"For what is consumed, he shall be made to pay with interest; for what is neglected, he shall pay an equal amount; and for property lost through ignorance, he should be made to pay somewhat less.\" By \"somewhat less\" is meant reduced by one-fourth.",
    "new": "However, where it is lost through neglect or ignorance, the same author shows a distinction: \"For what is consumed, he shall be made to pay with interest; for what is neglected, he shall pay an equal amount; and for property lost through ignorance, he should be made to pay somewhat less.\" By \"somewhat less\" is meant reduced by one-fifth.",
    "how": "fourth → fifth"
   }
